UID: GSSC-MLLR-INTRO-FRAMEWORK
STATEMENT: >>>
GSSC5-80 scaffolds this Members LLR document and the members Vitest harness. It claims no GSSC-MLLR-* requirement UIDs (mirrors public GSSC5-39: no testing-framework LLRs).
