[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-APP-ROOT
TITLE: Member App Root

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-APP-ROOT-ELEMENT
TITLE: App Root

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-1
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Member Frontend App Root SHALL contain a Page Outlet. When the member is logged in, the App Root SHALL also contain a Header host and a Footer host.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The App Root composes those subelements so Header, the active Member Frontend view, and Footer share one shell for authenticated contents. Header and Footer contents are separate requirements. Logged-out states omit Header and Footer hosts so the login experience is not wrapped in authenticated chrome.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: >>>
GSSC5-79
GSSC5-100
<<<
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-MHLR-13
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-2
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Member Frontend App Root SHALL fill the entire viewport.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The App Root is the outermost shell of the Member Frontend page. Filling the viewport gives Header, page content, and Footer a full-page layout that resizes with the viewport.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-79
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-MHLR-13
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-3
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Member Frontend App Root SHALL use the white theme token for its background and the sans-serif theme font for its text.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The outermost Member Frontend layer uses a white background and a sans-serif default. Theme tokens supply those values.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-79
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-MHLR-13
  ROLE: Refines

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-HEADER-HOST
TITLE: Header Host

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-4
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header host SHALL hold the Member Frontend Header.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The App Root supplies a host so Header implementation mounts in the Member Frontend shell. Header contents are separate requirements.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-79
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-MHLR-13
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-MHLR-15
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-5
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header host SHALL stick to the top of the viewport while the member scrolls.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Authenticated Member Frontend views keep the Header at the top. Sticking the host keeps that top placement as the member scrolls.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-79
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-MHLR-15
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-6
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header host SHALL inherit the App Root font and text color theme tokens.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The Header host is an empty mount for Header contents. It inherits App Root type tokens so the shell stays consistent until Header paints its own presentation. Independent Header host colors are not set yet.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-79
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-MHLR-15
