UID: GSSC-MLLR-HEADER
TITLE: Member Header

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-HEADER-BAR
TITLE: Header

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-14
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Member Frontend Header SHALL present the Header Logo, the Header Organization Name when the layout permits, the Header account-access controls, the Header Site Search control, the Header Theme Toggle, and the Navigation Menu, and SHALL omit a Donate control.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The Header composes those displayed elements in the Header host. Each element's behavior is a separate requirement. Account-access controls remain the Greeting dropdown (Public Access and Logout) when logged in, or login when logged out. Donate is omitted for v5.0.2.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Navigation Menu, Organization Name, and Site Search composition added for GSSC5-107. Theme Toggle composition added for GSSC5-125. Greeting dropdown Public Access added for GSSC-173. Donate omitted.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: >>>
GSSC5-81
GSSC5-107
GSSC5-125
GSSC-173
<<<
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-MHLR-15
  ROLE: Refines

