TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Member Frontend Header SHALL fill the Header host and arrange identity, Header actions, and the Navigation Menu according to the wide, mid, or narrow chrome tier in effect.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The Header host already sticks to the top of the viewport. Tiered chrome keeps Header contents available as the viewport and Navigation Menu width change.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Three-tier chrome replaces wrap-only Header arrangement for GSSC5-107.
