[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-665
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Nested Submenu Pointer Bridge SHALL keep a nested Navigation Submenu open while the pointer travels diagonally from that submenu's parent Navigation Item toward the submenu, and SHALL allow the pointer to reach sibling Navigation Items when travel leaves that diagonal path.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Diagonal travel toward a nested submenu is intentional; sibling hits outside that path must still retarget the menu.
<<<
