The Resources Prev control SHALL present a tailless previous-direction arrow icon with no border, rounded corners, the dark-green theme token for its icon color, a transparent background, and the gray theme token for its background on hover.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A borderless rounded icon control matches other Member Frontend icon buttons. Gray hover marks Prev as activatable without changing the icon color. A fuller control color map is not set yet beyond these token choices.
