  VALUE: GSSC-MHLR-45
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-307
TITLE: Persistence Feedback
STATEMENT: >>>
When create or modify fails because the Unified Backend rejects the request, the Announcements Editor Page SHALL show that the announcement was not saved and SHALL leave the editor fields available for correction when the member remains permitted to edit.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Permission and validation failures must be visible without implying a successful write.
<<<
