STATEMENT: >>>
The Dashboard Dynamic Sections SHALL place those sections at full width in the Page Outlet in the Unified Backend's section order, and SHALL omit the section list when the Unified Backend provides no such sections.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Backend section order is the display order; the page does not invent a separate ordering scheme. Omitting an empty list avoids blank chrome when content is absent.
<<<
