UID: GSSC-MLLR-238
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
Each Dashboard Section Modification editor SHALL appear at full width directly below the corresponding dashboard section display, and the Dashboard Page SHALL omit modification editors when the logged-in member does not have the necessary permissions or when there are no dashboard sections.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Placing the editor under its section keeps modification paired with the Contents being changed. Omitting unauthorized or empty editors avoids unused chrome.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-89
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-MHLR-28
  ROLE: Refines

