<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Reuse of the Generic Editor Module and form primitives keeps dashboard modification consistent with other Member Frontend editing surfaces.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-89
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
