[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-521
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Site Tree Editor Page SHALL retrieve the selected Public or Members site tree from the Unified Backend, present that tree for administrator inspection, and when the logged-in member is not an administrator, SHALL withhold create, modify, and delete controls while stating that administrator permission is required.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The page is the administrator surface for both frontend trees. Non-administrators may reach the route when logged in but must not mutate trees.
<<<
