UID: GSSC-MLLR-SITE-TREE-FRONTEND-SELECTOR
TITLE: Frontend Selector

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-524
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Frontend Selector SHALL let the administrator choose the Public Frontend site tree or the Members Frontend site tree, SHALL present the same frontend that the Site Tree Editor Page loads on the first presentation of the page, and when the choice changes the Site Tree Editor Page SHALL reload that tree from the Unified Backend and clear the current node selection.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Administrators switch between the two frontend trees without leaving the editor. Clearing selection avoids editing a node that is not in the newly loaded tree. Matching the selector to the loaded tree on first presentation prevents a mismatched Public label over a Members tree.
<<<
