UID: GSSC-MLLR-SITE-TREE-CREATE
TITLE: Create Child Node

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-533
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
When an administrator activates Create Child on a selected node, the Site Tree Editor Page SHALL create a new child node under that selected node in the selected site tree through the Unified Backend using the label, destination path, optional section tag, and sibling sort order from the Node Editor Panel, then SHALL reload the tree and select the created node.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Create Child grows the tree under the chosen parent. Reloading and selecting the new node lets the administrator confirm persistence immediately.
<<<
