UID: GSSC-MLLR-SITE-TREE-SAVE
TITLE: Save Node

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-534
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
When an administrator activates Save on a selected node, the Site Tree Editor Page SHALL persist that node's label, destination path, optional section tag, and sibling sort order to the Unified Backend for the selected site tree, then SHALL reload the tree and keep that node selected.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Save applies field edits including reorder via sort order. Reloading keeps the outline aligned with persisted state.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-116
