UID: GSSC-MLLR-SITE-TREE-DELETE
TITLE: Delete Node

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-535
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
When an administrator activates Delete on a selected non-root node, the Site Tree Editor Page SHALL delete that node through the Unified Backend for the selected site tree, then SHALL reload the tree and clear the node selection; Delete SHALL be unavailable for the tree root.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Non-root deletion removes obsolete destinations and descendants via the backend. The root stays so each frontend retains a single tree.
<<<
