UID: GSSC-MLLR-SITE-TREE-REORDER
TITLE: Reorder Sibling

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-536
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
When an administrator activates Move Up or Move Down on a selected non-root node that has a sibling in that direction, the Site Tree Editor Page SHALL exchange that node's sibling sort order with the adjacent sibling through the Unified Backend, then SHALL reload the tree and keep the moved node selected.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Move Up and Move Down provide explicit sibling reorder without requiring the administrator to edit sort-order numbers manually.
<<<
