UID: GSSC-MLLR-537
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Site Tree Editor Page SHALL enable Create Child, Save, Delete, Move Up, and Move Down only when the logged-in member is an administrator, and SHALL leave those controls disabled otherwise.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Unified Backend site-tree mutations require an administrator. The page mirrors that gate so non-administrators cannot attempt mutations.
