UID: GSSC-MLLR-NEWSLETTER-ISSUE-FILE-UPLOAD
TITLE: Newsletter Issue File Upload Persist

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-696
TITLE: Newsletter Issue File Upload Persist
STATEMENT: >>>
When Save succeeds on the Newsletter Editor with a newly chosen issue file, the Member Frontend SHALL upload that file to the Unified Backend newsletters store for the newsletter cuid and, on edit, SHALL replace the prior issue file for that newsletter.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Issue bytes are stored under the newsletter cuid; a replacement must not leave the previous file behind.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-142
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-MHLR-112
  ROLE: Refines

