[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-NEWSLETTER-VALIDATION
TITLE: Newsletter Editor Validation Feedback

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-706
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
When Save is refused because volume, number, month, or year is not a valid integer, or because a new newsletter has no chosen issue file, the Newsletter Editor SHALL mark each failing field invalid and SHALL omit create or modify until those fields are valid.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Red invalid marks show which inputs must be corrected before retrying Save; the generic error text alone is not enough.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC-192
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-MHLR-113
  ROLE: Refines

