STATEMENT: >>>
Invalid Newsletter Editor fields SHALL use the Member Frontend dark-red border and light-red field background.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Dark-red and light-red tokens match Account and Login invalid field chrome.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC-192
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
