[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-KVS-PERMISSION-SAVE-CANCEL-ROUTE
TITLE: Permission, Persist, Cancel, and Route

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-726
TITLE: Key-Value Modification Privilege
STATEMENT: >>>
The Member Frontend SHALL permit key-value create, save, and delete controls only when the signed-in member is an administrator.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Key-value catalog mutation matches the Unified Backend administrator privilege.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC-202
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-MHLR-115
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-727
TITLE: Key-Value Save Persist
STATEMENT: >>>
When Save succeeds on the Key-Value Store Editor, the Member Frontend SHALL create or replace the entry through the Unified Backend key-value upsert contract and then refresh the catalog list.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Save writes the key and value, then reloads the catalog so the list matches storage.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC-202
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-MHLR-115
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-728
TITLE: Key-Value Cancel
STATEMENT: >>>
When Cancel is activated on the Key-Value Store Editor, the Member Frontend SHALL restore key and value fields to the last loaded or last saved baseline without writing to the Unified Backend.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Cancel discards unsaved edits without a backend write.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC-202
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-MHLR-115
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-729
TITLE: Key-Value Store Editor Route
STATEMENT: >>>
The Member Frontend SHALL present the Key-Value Store Editor Page at the /kvs destination for a signed-in member.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A dedicated route mounts the editor behind member authentication.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC-202
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-MHLR-114
